  "description": "Application under Section 73 to vary the wording of Conditions 3 (Community Infrastructure Levy phasing plan) and 4 (Approved plans) - in order to provide clarity that the planning permission is a phased permission, attached to planning application 22/00098/FUL_LLDC dated 22nd May 2023 which granted permission for:\r\r\"Demolition of existing buildings and redevelopment of the site to provide a part 12, part 25 storey building (plus 2 basement levels) for a mixed-use development comprising 465 student accommodation rooms (Sui Generis), 786sqm workspace (Class E), a new public house consisting of 141sqm (Sui Generis) with hard and soft landscaping, public realm improvements including enhancements to the Channelsea River, a new vehicular access, parking and associated works. This application is accompanied by an Environmental Statement (ES) (dated February 2022) submitted pursuant to the Town and Country Planning (Environmental Impact Assessment) Regulations (2017), as amended\".",
